{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"af9e49a3fb2f39bb","name":"card_unit_16th_tarnow_regiment","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Poland/units/card_unit_16th_tarnow_regiment","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"16th TARNOW REGIMENT","text":"When you play an Intel card, add a LEGIONS to the support line and draw a card.","flavorText":"The 16th Land of Tarnow Infantry Regiment was a unit of the 6th Infantry Division of the Polish Army. The division was formed in 1918 and fought in the Polish–Soviet War between 1919-1921. In 1939 the division was part of the Kraków Army and during the invasion of Poland it defended against the German 5th Panzer Division in the villages of Brzezce and Wisla Wielkathat that are located in the south of Poland. During the battle the 6th Division suffered heavy casualties, but managed to hold its positions until ordered to withdraw. The division would continue the fighting near Biskupice Radłowskie and later in the Battle of Tomaszów Lubelski where it surrendered to the German forces on September 20.","faction":"Poland","type":"infantry","rarity":"Rare","cost":4,"operationCost":2,"attack":4,"defense":6},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_unit_16th_tarnow_regiment","title":{"Namespace":"card_poland","Key":"card_unit_16th_tarnow_regiment_title","SourceString":"16th TARNOW REGIMENT","LocalizedString":"16th TARNOW REGIMENT"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::infantry","attack":4,"defense":6,"range":1,"faction":"EFactionEnum::Poland","kredits":4,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_poland","Key":"card_unit_16th_tarnow_regiment_text","SourceString":"When you play an Intel card, add a LEGIONS to the support line and draw a card.","LocalizedString":"When you play an Intel card, add a LEGIONS to the support line and draw a card."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_poland","Key":"card_unit_16th_tarnow_regiment_history","SourceString":"The 16th Land of Tarnow Infantry Regiment was a unit of the 6th Infantry Division of the Polish Army. The divi